1
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,435
[sdh] Good morning, everyone.

2
00:00:15,335 --> 00:00:17,590
[sdh] Did you sleep well?

3
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:21,445
[sdh] Barely. The storm kept me up.

4
00:00:22,845 --> 00:00:25,505
[sdh] We should leave before noon.

5
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:29,200
[sdh] The road south is still closed.

6
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,785
[sdh] Then we take the river.

7
00:00:34,185 --> 00:00:37,295
[sdh] Is that even possible in this weather?

8
00:00:38,195 --> 00:00:40,450
[sdh] It is the only way.

9
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:44,485
[sdh] I counted four boats at the dock.

10
00:00:45,885 --> 00:00:48,140
[sdh] Three of them leak.

11
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,250
[sdh] Of course they do.

12
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:55,240
[sdh] Take the one with the blue sail.

13
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:59,030
[sdh] You are enjoying this.

14
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:01,735
[sdh] A little.

15
00:01:02,885 --> 00:01:05,365
[sdh] What about the supplies?

16
00:01:06,765 --> 00:01:08,840
[sdh] Already loaded.

17
00:01:09,740 --> 00:01:11,770
[sdh] And the radio?

18
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:15,715
[sdh] Dead battery. I left it behind.

19
00:01:17,115 --> 00:01:19,190
[sdh] We will manage.

20
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:22,930
[sdh] That is what you said last time.

21
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:26,200
[sdh] And we survived.

22
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:29,360
[sdh] By luck.

23
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:32,200
[sdh] Luck counts.

24
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:35,515
[sdh] Look at that sky.

25
00:01:36,915 --> 00:01:38,945
[sdh] It is turning.

26
00:01:39,845 --> 00:01:42,235
[sdh] We have maybe an hour.

27
00:01:43,385 --> 00:01:46,360
[sdh] Then stop talking and start rowing.

28
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,610
[sdh] After you.

29
00:01:50,510 --> 00:01:52,900
[sdh] Careful with the rope.

30
00:01:54,050 --> 00:01:56,530
[sdh] I have done this before.

31
00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:00,545
[sdh] Not in a current like this.

32
00:02:01,445 --> 00:02:04,105
[sdh] Watch the rocks on the left.

33
00:02:05,255 --> 00:02:07,150
[sdh] I see them.

34
00:02:08,550 --> 00:02:10,760
[sdh] Hard to starboard!

35
00:02:11,660 --> 00:02:13,240
[sdh] Now!

36
00:02:14,390 --> 00:02:16,465
[sdh] That was close.

37
00:02:17,865 --> 00:02:19,715
[sdh] Too close.

38
00:02:20,615 --> 00:02:22,780
[sdh] The hull is fine.

39
00:02:23,930 --> 00:02:26,275
[sdh] The hull is not fine.

40
00:02:27,675 --> 00:02:30,110
[sdh] We are taking on water.

41
00:02:31,010 --> 00:02:33,265
[sdh] Bail. I will steer.

42
00:02:34,415 --> 00:02:36,400
[sdh] For how long?

43
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,280
[sdh] Until we reach the bend.

44
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:43,975
[sdh] There is a cabin past the bend.

45
00:02:45,125 --> 00:02:47,470
[sdh] Empty since the fire.

46
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:50,720
[sdh] Not empty.

47
00:02:51,620 --> 00:02:53,875
[sdh] You are impossible.

48
00:02:55,025 --> 00:02:57,055
[sdh] I am prepared.
